# Moyu Cloud Platform - Cursor & AI Rules

## Branch Protection & Commit Guidelines
- Commit messages must follow Conventional Commits standard: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, `refactor:`.
- Direct pushes to `main` and `develop` are strictly prohibited. Always submit PR from `feature/<module>` or `fix/<ticket>`.
- Rebase `develop` daily before creating PR.

## Code Quality & Annotation Standards
- Add `@Feature`, `@Version`, `@SonarLint` headers to module files.
- Unit test coverage requirement: >= 70%.
- Blocker/Critical Sonar issues: 0 allowed.

## Architectural Boundaries
- Frontend: Single Page Dashboard with high-fidelity UI matching Moyu Cloud IP Derivative specifications.
- Core Modules: Keep pure functions in `src/modules/` with 100% unit test coverage in `test/`.
